# Code owners are used for review requests, not as a merge gate: the gate is the
# required "Studio artifact" check (fail closed without an approving review on the
# exact head) plus the repository's required approvals.
#
# Deliberately coarse: one rule per privileged area. The enforced path list lives
# in scripts/build-surface.mjs and is what the workflow actually checks.
/.github/           @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/scripts/           @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/site/              @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/netlify.toml       @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/netlify/           @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/vendor/            @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/package.json       @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
/package-lock.json  @qiffang @srstack @mornyx @mashenjun
